    49	
    50	The underlying URLs support more than the excerpt files retained in the repository, but `AGENT.md` requires the saved excerpt itself to say what the checked claim says.
    51	
    52	- “They issued warnings, requirements and seven fines” is supported by p. 9 of the Inspectorate PDF (219 warnings, 17 requirements, seven fines), but `04-enforcement.txt` saves only the fine and visit lines.
