 <p>Build ten prospect types, then qualify the chemical and task rather than assuming exposure from a trade label. Screen spray-foam insulation contractors, PU-floor installers, industrial protective-coating firms, car body shops and commercial-vehicle refinishers. Add rail-coating contractors, yacht and ship painters, composite fabricators, spray-adhesive users and PU-elastomer processors. Exclude firms whose safety data sheets stay below the REACH threshold or whose work never creates the defined spray exposure.</p>
