+<p>The precedent is Synergy Environmental Solutions in Stoke-on-Trent. Its occupational-hygiene arm markets air and biological isocyanate monitoring for vehicle refinishing, PU foam, adhesive spraying, composites and industrial coating. <!-- CHECK: 04-precedent-offer --> Companies House independently records company 07937140 as active, incorporated on 6 February 2012, with environmental consulting among its activities and accounts through March 2025. <!-- CHECK: 04-precedent-trace --> This shows that an active, independently traceable company currently offers the service shape elsewhere. It does not prove the service's age or economics, or transfer British customer behaviour to the Netherlands.</p>
 <p>The constraint that breaks the fit is availability for real site work. Spraying cannot be reconstructed from a weekend spreadsheet, and a representative job may move at short notice. The reader needs reserved weekdays beside the day job and a partner who can attend or accept controlled fieldwork. A two-year qualification route would change the economics, but it violates the agreed retraining constraint.</p>
